{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act41side_level_act41side_02_beg","storyGroup":"act41side","storySort":4,"storyDependence":"act41side_level_act41side_01_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"EA-2","storyName":"不过别离","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"城中饥荒爆发，对维多利亚人的仇恨也被刻意煽动起来。库林试图分发存粮以维持秩序，而涅梅丝接过库林寻找提奥的托付，在四处寻找无果后碰上了拉芙希妮。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act41side/level_act41side_02_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act41side_02","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":2,"next":4,"characters":["提奥","急切的居民","愤怒的居民","库林","友善的居民","阴沉的居民","焦急的居民","涅梅丝","冷漠的居民","沉默的居民","？？？","“歌唱家”","拉芙希妮"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_bg_59_g1_citystreets_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"cr","id":6},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"cr","fadetime":"2","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$mist_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1695_1#1$1","duration":"0.7","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1696_1#1$1","duration":"0.7","id":12},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":13},{"type":"charslot","id":14},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":15},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1686_1#1$1","duration":"0.7","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1689_1#1$1","duration":"0.7","id":17},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":18},{"type":"charslot","id":19},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_footstep_stonestep","volume":"1","channel":"step","loop":"false","id":20},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"step","fadetime":"2","id":21},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_240","duration":"1","id":22},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_240","focus":"m","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"提奥","text":"......嗯？","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"提奥","text":"好多人......","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"提奥","text":"抱歉！呃......请让一让——","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":28},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovementsp","volume":"1","id":29},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.7","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":30},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"提奥","text":"——啊！","id":32},{"type":"dialog","id":33},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":34},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1687_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的居民","text":"——米林顿街我也去过了，早就什么也没有了！虽然店门都开着，但货架全是空的，连个袋子都没剩下！","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1687_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的居民","text":"克拉马那家伙说这边有库存，我才跑了五条街过来——结果还是连根羽兽毛都看不见！","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1687_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的居民","text":"我还不如回去拿上弩，翻出岗哨去，到黑林里打点猎，兴许还能在饿死之前见点真正的荤腥......","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1687_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_240","focus":"m","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"提奥","text":"......什么？","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1689_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的居民","text":"我看你是真饿糊涂了，去黑林才真的是去送死！","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1689_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1687_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的居民","text":"你不糊涂！说得像你就知道什么了一样！","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1687_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1689_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的居民","text":"怎么不知道？拉格兰街的粮店，艾玛开的，你知道吧？","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1689_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1687_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的居民","text":"那家我还没去呢，怎么了？","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1687_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1689_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的居民","text":"我先去的那里。虽然也没粮食，但听艾玛的意思，这事和*维多利亚粗口*的维多利亚人脱不开干系！","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1689_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1687_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的居民","text":"维多利亚的混蛋封锁我们，这又不是第一天了，他们当然该负责。这有什么新鲜的？","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1687_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1689_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的居民","text":"维多利亚的间谍已经渗透到纳斯尔纱来了！","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1689_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1687_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的居民","text":"你再说一遍？！","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1687_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1689_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的居民","text":"艾玛去农业地块的时候亲眼看见了着过火的痕迹，深池还在排查呢！","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1689_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1687_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":59},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的居民","text":"*维多利亚粗口*！塔拉独立之后我们就该马上打回去！","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1687_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1689_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的居民","text":"不过有句话你说对了，你确实该回去拿上你的弩，但不是为了打猎，而是为了揪出那些替维多利亚人办事的叛徒！","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1689_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的居民","text":"虽然如果让我抓到他，肯定不是用弩箭穿心这么简单就结束了。","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1689_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":65},{"type":"charslot","id":66},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":67},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"0.7","id":68},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_footstep_stonestep","volume":"0.6","channel":"step","loop":"false","id":69},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"step","fadetime":"1.5","id":70},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_240","duration":"0.7","id":71},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":72},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_240","focus":"m","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"提奥","text":"（小声）好像是这些店里的粮食供应断了......","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"提奥","text":"（小声）虽然我给库林先生囤了一些土豆，但可能还是不够......","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"提奥","text":"（小声）这里人太多了，还是走另一条路吧。","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"提奥","text":"（小声）还有好多人都拿着武器......","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"提奥","text":"（小声）他们是想围剿维多利亚间谍吗？城里没有粮食......跟维多利亚人也有关系吗？","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"提奥","text":"（小声）但我......","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"提奥","text":"（小声）我......","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":81},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_240","focus":"m","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"提奥","text":"我没关系的。我是库林先生的学徒。大家都知道这件事。","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"提奥","text":"别害怕，提奥。大家不会拿你怎么样的。","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":86},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cloakmovement","volume":"1","id":87},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":88},{"type":"text","text":"提奥努力矮下身子，从人群中挤出去，来到街道的拐角处。他灵活地从一条狭窄暗道里穿过，来到石砖墙体的另一面。","id":89},{"type":"text","text":"嘈杂的人声逐渐从他耳边退去。","id":90},{"type":"dialog","id":91},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":92},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"cr","fadetime":"1","id":93},{"type":"charslot","id":94},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_bg_59_g1_citystreets_d.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":95},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":96},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":97},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":98},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_240","focus":"m","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"提奥","text":"......你看，提奥，没人找你的麻烦。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"提奥","text":"库林先生肯定还在忙红龙雕像的事，等他回过神来，其他店里肯定也什么都不剩了。","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"提奥","text":"我得帮忙。","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":103},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_footstep_stonestep","volume":"0.6","channel":"step1","loop":"false","id":104},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"step1","fadetime":"3","id":105},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":106},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":107},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":108},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":109},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":110},{"type":"charslot","id":111},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_bg_59_g10_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":112},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":113},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":114,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":115},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":116},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"你们先把这些东西拿去吃，分给周围的邻居，让他们不要急。","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"友善的居民","text":"那你自己怎么办？还有涅梅丝，她会不会没得吃？","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_1688_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"友善的居民","text":"比起把粮食都给我们，你不如跟那些人一起去抓维多利亚间谍。要不然没法从根本上解决问题，是不是？","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_1688_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":122},{"type":"multiline","name":"库林","text":"......我会去的，也麻烦你这样告诉其他人。","id":123},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":124},{"type":"multiline","name":"库林","text":"这些东西你们也先拿着。","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"涅梅丝在领袖的身边，为你们吃些苦也是应该的。","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"友善的居民","text":"那我......那我就不跟你客气了！","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_1688_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1686_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阴沉的居民","text":"......库林，你肯定还有别的存粮，是不是？","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_npc_1686_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阴沉的居民","text":"而且，你怎么知道粮食会断供？是不是涅梅丝提前跟你说了什么——","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_npc_1686_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"友善的居民","text":"罗里，你说什么呢！","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_1688_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"你不要就算了。","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1686_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阴沉的居民","text":"有谁能证明你或者涅梅丝不是间谍？你们合起伙来养大了一个维多利亚人的孩子！","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_npc_1686_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"......滚。","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1686_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阴沉的居民","text":"我凭什么滚？你心虚什么？你——","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_npc_1686_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":142},{"type":"charslot","id":143},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":144},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":145},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1752_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":146},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":147},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1752_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的居民","text":"库林，我听说你在发粮，真是太及时了！你发的东西都在哪儿呢？","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_1752_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"剩下的都在这里了。","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1686_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阴沉的居民","text":"别打岔。库林，你还没回答我的问题。","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_npc_1686_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"能说的我都已经说了。你要是觉得这点土豆脏了你的手，就把袋子给别人。","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1686_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阴沉的居民","text":"你？！","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_npc_1686_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1752_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的居民","text":"罗里，你到底要不要？不要就给我，多的是人要吃饭，别不识好歹。","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_1752_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的居民","text":"给我——","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_1752_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1686_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阴沉的居民","text":"凭什么？","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_npc_1686_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1752_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的居民","text":"你不是不要吗，给我！","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_1752_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1686_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阴沉的居民","text":"想得美——","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_npc_1686_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":167},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1752_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":168},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":169},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovementsp","volume":"1","id":170},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.7","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.52","scale":"1.1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","id":172},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":173},{"type":"charslot","id":174},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1686_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":175},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_exsheath","id":176},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":177},{"type":"charslot","id":178},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1752_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":179},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_knife","volume":"0.7","id":180},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.8","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":181},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"1","g":"0.2","b":"0.2","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":182},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.4","r":"1","g":"0.2","b":"0.2","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":183},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"1","g":"0.2","b":"0.2","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的居民","text":"呃——啊！","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_1752_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":186},{"type":"charslot","id":187},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_orangefall","volume":"1","id":188},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":189},{"type":"text","text":"袋子里的土豆个头极小，没一个长成正常的椭圆形。","id":190},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1752_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":191},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的居民","text":"我的胳膊？！","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_1752_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"友善的居民","text":"天哪，出血了！罗里，你怎么能对同胞动刀？！","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_1688_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1686_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阴沉的居民","text":"......我、我——","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_npc_1686_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":198},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":199},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":200},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_axeimp","volume":"1","id":201},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.8","xstrength":"50","ystrength":"50","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":202},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":203},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"把刀放下。","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"别逼我用这把锤子对付你。","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":207},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1686_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":208},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bellfall","volume":"1","id":209},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":210},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.6","id":211},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":212},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":213},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"友善的居民","text":"还、还得是你啊，库林。","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_1688_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"......","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"友善的居民","text":"罗里的状态不太对，我跟上去瞧瞧......自从他收藏的那些古董在战争中被一把火烧了之后，他就一直疯疯癫癫的。","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_1688_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"友善的居民","text":"至于他的刀——他的刀你就收起来吧，库林。别再还给他了。","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_1688_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":221},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_footstep_stonestep","volume":"0.6","channel":"wstep","loop":"false","id":222},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"wstep","fadetime":"2","id":223},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":224},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":225},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1752_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的居民","text":"库林，我......唉......","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_1752_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"伤口不深，过来，我先帮你止血。粮食的事，等涅梅丝回来，我请她想想办法。","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1752_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的居民","text":"我知道......嘶......我知道，你是真的把自己有的都拿出来了。","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_1752_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"multiline","name":"焦急的居民","text":"你也就是看上去凶巴巴的——","id":232},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","random":"true","power":"5","times":"60","duration":"0.3","id":233},{"type":"multiline","name":"焦急的居民","text":"嘶！","id":234},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"少说话，节省力气。","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"家里可能还剩了点玉米粉，我去找找。","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"你拿上，然后我送你回去。","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":239},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":240},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":241},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":242},{"type":"charslot","id":243},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_bg_59_g10_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":244},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":245},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loading_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_sys_loading_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":246,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":247},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":248},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":249},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":250},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#1$1","duration":"0.7","id":251},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":252},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"库林，你和提奥还好——","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3d/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":255},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":256},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":257},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"......地上怎么有血？","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"罗里失控砍伤了人。","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"提奥呢？","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"提奥一早就出去了——","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"......糟了！","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":268},{"type":"multiline","name":"涅梅丝","text":"你——","id":269},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":270},{"type":"multiline","name":"涅梅丝","text":"唉，算了，没人能想到事情会突然变成这样。","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"城里现在怎么样了？","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"到处都在传是维多利亚人破坏了农业地块，纳斯尔纱已经快炸锅了。","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"我知道，你之前给提奥出了一次头之后没人敢欺负他，你才放心他到处跑。可这次......不一样。","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"那我现在去找他——","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"那你的雕像还来得及吗？","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":281},{"type":"multiline","name":"库林","text":"雕像得在夏末节前完工，时间只剩一点点了......","id":282},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":283},{"type":"multiline","name":"库林","text":"该死，该死！","id":284},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"提奥的事我会去管。你就专心做好手头的事吧。","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"......","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"嗯。","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":291},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":292},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":293},{"type":"charslot","id":294},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_bg_59_g1_citystreets_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":295},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":296},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":297},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":298},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":299},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"看见提奥了吗？","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"友善的居民","text":"提奥？那孩子又跑到哪里偷懒去了？库林太惯着他了，你真该说说他......","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_1688_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":304},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","text":"","id":305},{"type":"charslot","id":306},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_bg_59_g3_dragonsquare_d.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":307},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":308},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":309},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":310},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":311},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"提奥，提奥！","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1696_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷漠的居民","text":"那小子闯什么祸了，让你这么找？","id":315,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1696_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":316},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","text":"","id":317},{"type":"charslot","id":318},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_bg_59_g1_citystreets_d.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":319},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":320},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":321},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":322},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":323},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"看见过提奥吗？","id":325,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1687_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉默的居民","text":"......","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1687_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"你还好吗？","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1687_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉默的居民","text":"......我？我还好，就是太饿了。怎么了？你刚才说什么？","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1687_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":332},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","text":"","id":333},{"type":"charslot","id":334},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_bg_59_g1_citystreets_d.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":335},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":336},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":337},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":338},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1689_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的居民","text":"你来得正好！涅梅丝，提奥那小子最近没什么可疑行为吧？","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1689_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"......没有，他忙还忙不过来呢。","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1689_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的居民","text":"哼，他最好是。","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1689_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":345},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","text":"","id":346},{"type":"charslot","id":347},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_bg_59_g1_citystreets_d.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":348},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":349},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":350},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":351},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":352},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":353},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"提奥！","id":354,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":355},{"type":"charslot","id":356},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"“守灵人”小姐？你怎么还在这儿？","id":358},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"你是——哦，“歌唱家”先生。您在这儿做什么？","id":360,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3d/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":361},{"type":"charslot","id":362},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_247","duration":"0.7","id":363},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":364},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_247","focus":"m","id":365},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“歌唱家”","text":"听闻城中发生了一些混乱，我想看看有没有什么自己能做的，结果，唉，无能为力，只听说供应短缺是维多利亚人破坏所致。","id":366,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_247.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_247","focus":"m","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“歌唱家”","text":"可我唯一一次和维多利亚人的军队碰上纯属意外，那次还是承蒙您和库林先生把我救出来的。","id":368,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_247.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“歌唱家”","text":"还有您为我提供的关于守灵人的信息，真的令我受益良多——","id":369,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_247.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"抱歉，“歌唱家”先生，我实在没时间和您叙旧了——对了，您能帮我个忙吗？库林的学徒提奥失踪了，您能帮我找找他吗？","id":371,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_247","focus":"m","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“歌唱家”","text":"这......我爱莫能助。","id":373,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_247.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_247","focus":"m","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“歌唱家”","text":"城里人现在提起维多利亚人恨不得扒了他们的皮，你又何苦为了一个维多利亚小孩四处奔忙呢？","id":375,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_247.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"算了，我自己找。","id":377,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_247","focus":"m","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“歌唱家”","text":"我也得给您提个醒，庆功会还有一个多小时就开始了，您不是还要把象征守灵人祝福的祭器送到会场去吗？","id":379,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_247.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"啧！","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9f/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_247","focus":"m","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“歌唱家”","text":"唉，您也真是......抱歉，我先失陪了。","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_247.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":384},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.6","id":385},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":386},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":387},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"......","id":389,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"这下......","id":390,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":391},{"type":"charslot","id":392},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_runstop","volume":"1","id":393},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#11$1","duration":"0.5","id":394},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":395},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":396},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"涅梅丝，是你吗？","id":397,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1694_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"终于找到你了......城里到底出什么事了？","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1694_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":399},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":400},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":401},{"type":"charslot","id":402},{"type":"image","id":403}],"characters":["提奥","急切的居民","愤怒的居民","库林","友善的居民","阴沉的居民","焦急的居民","涅梅丝","冷漠的居民","沉默的居民","？？？","“歌唱家”","拉芙希妮"]}